IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTMNT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RECORD-COUNT     PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-ERROR-FLAG       PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-CUSTOMER-NAME    PIC X(30).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0100-VERIFY-RECORD.
           IF WS-CUSTOMER-NAME = SPACES
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ERROR-FLAG
               GO TO 0900-ERROR-EXIT
           END-IF.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RECORD-COUNT.
           GO TO 0200-CONTINUE.
       0200-CONTINUE.
           DISPLAY "CUSTOMER VALIDATED OK".
           STOP RUN.
       0900-ERROR-EXIT.
           DISPLAY "CRITICAL: EMPTY CUSTOMER RECORD".
           STOP RUN.